2. Izindi nzego zashyirwaho n’Inteko Rusange.

(a) kugena politiki rusange z’Umuryango;
(b) kwakira, gusuzuma no gufata icyemezo kuri
raporo n’inama zitangwa n’izindi nzego
z’Umuryango;
(c) gusuzuma ibyifuzo bisaba kuba
umunyamuryango;
(d) gushyiraho urwego urwo ari rwo rwose
rw’Umuryango;
(e) gukurikirana ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya
politiki n’ibyemezo by’Umuryango no
kugenzura niba ibihugu byose bigize
Umuryango bibyubahiriza;
(f) kwemeza ingengo y’imari y’Umuryango;
(g) guha amabwiriza Inama Nyobozi ku
byerekeye gukemura amakimbirane, guhosha
intambara guhangana n’ibindi bihe bidasanzwe
no kugarura amahoro;
(h) gushyiraho no kuvanaho abacamanza
b’Urukiko;
(i) gushyiraho Umuyobozi wa Komisiyo
n’Umwungirije cyangwa abamwungirije
n’Abakomiseri bagize Komisiyo no kugena
imirimo na manda byabo.
2. Inteko Rusange ishobora guha ububasha
n’inshingano izo ari zo zose zayo urwego urwo
ari rwo rwose rw’Umuryango.

inyungu rusange z’ibihugu binyamuryango,
birimo ibi bikurikira:
(a) ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga;
(b) ingufu, inganda n’umutungo kamere
w’amabuye y’agaciro;
(c) ibiribwa, ibikomoka ku buhinzi no ku
matungo, ubworozi n’amashyamba;
(d) amazi no kuhira;
(e) kubungabunga ibidukikije, ibikorwa
by’ubutabazi mu bihe by’intambara no mu bihe
by’ibiza;
(f) ubwikorezi n’itumanaho;
(g) ubwishingizi ;
(h)uburezi, umuco, ubuzima n’iterambere
ry’imicungire y’abakozi;
(i) ubumenyi n’ikoranabuhanga.
(j) ibirebana n’ubwenegihugu, gutuza
abanyamahanga n’ibyerekeye abimukira;
(k) ubwiteganyirize, harimo itegurwa rya politiki
zo kwita ku mwana na nyina, ndetse na politiki
zerekeye abafite ubumuga ;
(l) ishyirwaho ry’uburyo ibihembo, imidali
n’amashimwe bitangwa muri Afurika.
2. Inama Nyobozi igenzurwa n’Inteko Rusange.
Isuzuma ibibazo yashyikirijwe kandi
igakurikirana ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya politiki
zitegurwa n’Inteko Rusange.
3. Inama Nyobozi ishobora guha Komite
Zihariye z’ibijyanye na Tekiniki, zishyirwaho
hakurikijwe ingingo ya 14 y’aya Masezerano,
ububasha n’inshingano zayo zimwe na zimwe
ziteganyijwe mu gika cya mbere cy’iyi ngingo.

(a) itegura imishinga na gahunda z’Umuryango
ikabishyikiriza Inama Nyobozi;
(b) igenzura, ikurikirana ikanasuzuma ishyirwa
mu bikorwa ry’ibyemezo bifatwa n’inzego
z’Umuryango;
(c) ihuza ibikorwa by’imishinga na gahunda
by’Umuryango;
(d) iha Inama Nyobozi raporo n’inama ku
ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry’ibiteganyijwe n’aya
Masezerano ibyibwirije cyangwa ibiyisabye;
(e) ikora indi mirimo yose ihawe, mu rwego rwo
gushyira mu bikorwa ibiteganyijwe muri aya
Masezerano.
